*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Ekans}}.
*{{m|Bite}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Ekans}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

